  {
   "line": 7,
   "text": "So what is it? [surprise-oh] It's two tones. A one thousand hertz tone, minus a three thousand hertz tone a sixth its size, lands exactly on every clipped sample. That second tone is the buzz. Nobody said it. The booster made it, out of nothing.",
